    (hmcont : ContinuousOn m (Icc 0 T)) (hmbarcont : ContinuousOn mbar (Icc 0 T))
    (hnorm : EuclideanNormalizedOn m d C t₀) (hnormbar : EuclideanNormalizedOn mbar d C t₀) :
    ∀ ⦃t : ℝ⦄, t ∈ Ioo 0 T → m t ≤ mbar t := by ...
```
